id: DRAFT-libscca-20250915-config-sub-ohos-triplet-top-shortcircuit-verify
trigger_tool: conan|configure|sh
phase: configuring
error_signature: Invalid configuration 'aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos'.*Kernel 'linux' not known to work with OS 'ohos'|config\.sub aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos failed
severity: 3
category: autotools, build-system, ohos, compat
match_keywords: autotools_configure, config_sub, ohos_triplet, linux-ohos, Invalid configuration
title: 老旧config.sub不识别OHOS三元组时的顶部短路识别与全树自检验补丁
root_cause: libscca-20250915自带2024-01-01版config.sub无linux-ohos内核校验分支，旧_patch_config_sub第三步锚点\tos2-emx)缺失导致补丁静默跳过；内部校验分支随版本漂移逐行锚定不可靠
affected_scope: 自带老旧config.sub且需识别aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos等OHOS三元组的autotools类库，configure阶段做build system type校验即退出者
verification_cmd: 真机shell实执行config.sub aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos返回0并回显规范三元组，且preflight不再报Invalid configuration，9组本地sh实测OHOS通过且gnu无回归
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: ohos-triplet-top-shortcircuit-with-fulltree-verify
rec_description: shebang后插入仅匹配*-linux-ohos和*-ohos-linux的case提前返回短路块并回显规范三元组，其余输入落回原逻辑；os.walk全树补丁全部config.sub副本，补丁后立即实执行自检，静默漏补直接抛错
rec_command: archives/l/libscca/20250915/conanfile.py重写_patch_config_sub插入短路块，build()改走os.walk全树打补丁，新增_verify_config_sub用_ohos_shell实执行config.sub aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos自检
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-patch
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: three-step-robust-internal-anchor-patch
fallback_description: 与scripts/patch-autotools-ohos.pl对齐的三步内部补丁，兼容新旧版式锚定ohos-linux三元组、ohos系统列表与linux-ohos内核校验，仅作短路块不可用时的降级保留
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: Kernel 'linux' not known to work with OS 'ohos'
forbid_1_reason: 禁止只补顶层config.sub或只做内部锚点替换而不做全树实执行自检，残留副本仍会以同错退出且静默漏补难排查
forbid_1_consequence: 真机configure仍报Invalid configuration，checking build system type直接失败，门禁v2:compile:configure_failed不通过
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-libscca-20250915-config-sub-ohos-triplet-top-shortcircuit-verify.md
last_updated: 2026-09-18
source_event: libscca/20250915真机conan create配置阶段Invalid configuration失败经顶部短路加全树自检验修复并通过全部门禁
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 10753
